한국남부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 37번","searchText":" 37\n\n전류의 지시값 3개와 20Ω의 저항을 이용하여 부하의\n역률을 측정하고자 한다. 전류계의 지시값이 10A,\n5A , 6A 인 경우, 부하 역률은 몇 인가?\n\n\n① 65          ② 70\n\n③ 75          ④ 80","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.10 한국남부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e02-m37","number":37},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e02-m37-q.webp","width":678,"height":548},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e02-m37-e1.webp","width":678,"height":291},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e02-m37-e2.webp","width":696,"height":356}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P080-S2-Q13","number":13,"question":"25.05.10 한국남부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 38번","searchText":" 38\n\n다음과 같은 회로의  단자에 내부저항이 ∞인 전압계\n\n를 접속할 때, 전압계에서 측정되는 전압값은 몇 V인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 5           ② 10\n\n③ 15          ④ 20","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.10 한국남부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e02-m38","number":38},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e02-m38-q.webp","width":696,"height":723},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e02-m38-e1.webp","width":696,"height":867}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P080-S2-Q14","number":14,"question":"25.05.10 한국남부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 39번","searchText":" 39\n\n폭이 5s, 주파수가 200Hz인 펄스의 전력을 열량계로\n\n측정하여 10W를 얻었다. 이 펄스의 최대전력은 몇 kW\n\n인가?\n\n\n① 2           ② 5\n\n③ 10          ④ 50","source":{"collect